  "description": "ASAP7 predictive 7nm FinFET \u2014 research/education. Exercises the schema at an advanced node: MULTIPLE Vt cell_libraries (RVT + LVT shown; SLVT + SRAM also ship), split Liberty (per-cell-group files -> lib is an array; abbreviated here to SIMPLE+SEQ, the real PDK ships ~5 groups per corner per Vt), 3 corners, FinFET SPICE + BSIM-CMG models. GOTCHA: drawn at 4x scale (note the *_4x_* collateral) \u2014 any consuming flow must apply the 4x. Mirrored under github.com/vyges-tools; root + paths illustrative of asap7_pdk_r1p7."
